OL,3,GNEWSAEx-roads minister Guy Opperman    
OL,4,Abanned from driving                    
OL,6,FFormer roads minister and Conservative 
OL,7,FMP Guy Opperman has been banned from   
OL,8,Fdriving.                               
OL,10,FOpperman was caught speeding in        
OL,11,FLambeth, South London, in May and      
OL,12,Falready had nine points on his licence.
OL,14,FThe former Hexham MP admitted the      
OL,15,Fspeeding offence at Bromley            
OL,16,FMagistrates' Court on 13 November.     
OL,18,FHe has been banned from driving for six
OL,19,Fmonths and ordered to pay #560 made up 
OL,20,Fof a #307 fine, #130 costs and a court 
OL,21,Fsurcharge of #123.                     
